# Local gateway connection for the OpenClaw sidebar app.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Both are optional — leave blank to run in
# demo mode (mock data, no gateway).
#
# LOCAL DEV: use the Vite dev proxy (http://localhost:5174/gw), NOT the gateway
# directly. The gateway's plugin route doesn't emit CORS headers and 401s on
# the OPTIONS preflight, so a browser can't reach it cross-origin. The /gw
# prefix is proxied to the gateway server-side (no CORS) with a loopback Origin
# injected. The gateway target itself is set in vite.config.ts via
# OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TARGET (default http://localhost:18789).
#
# For deployment, point this at the real gateway origin (and ensure the
# gateway allows that origin / put a proxy in front).

VITE_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:5174/gw
VITE_GATEWAY_TOKEN=<your-gateway-bearer-token>